---
layout: base.njk
title: "DUE — Essays"
---
<section class="hero card">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0">Publish under pressure.</h2>
  <p>One topic. Thirty days. Essays go live finished or not. Minor contributions are acknowledged; major ones earn coauthorship. Every essay evolves with semantic versioning.</p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/issues/new?template=new-essay.yml">Start a new essay</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/issues/new?template=suggest-change.yml">Suggest a change</a>
  </div>
</section>

<h2>Published Essays</h2>
{% for post in collections.publishedEssays %}
  <div class="card">
    <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <div class="meta">
      <span class="badge">v{{ post.data.version }}</span>
      <span class="badge">{{ post.data.word_range }} words</span>
      <span class="badge">{{ post.data.initial_status == "complete" ? "Published completed" : "Published unfinished" }}</span>
      {% if post.data.published_at %}<span>Published: {{ post.data.published_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if post.data.release_notes and post.data.release_notes.length %}
      <p><strong>Latest:</strong> {{ post.data.release_notes[0] }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% else %}
  <p>No essays published yet.</p>
{% endfor %}

<hr>

<h2>About</h2>
<p><strong>DUE — Deadline for Unfinished Essays</strong> publishes short essays under a 30‑day deadline. Finished or not, they go live. Minor contributions are acknowledged; major contributions earn coauthorship. Essays evolve using semantic versioning.</p>
